			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4488458">
									

<p>I'm hesitant, but I've tentatively upvoted for now because of the very specific vibe I get from this. It's very close to the whole X-Men &quot;what if cool character with powers but anomaly&quot; thing, but I feel that it manages to just barely scoot around that.</p>
<p>It's a folk hero. What has he really done? Probably jack shit, really. People just like to tell tall tales, and he uses his illusions to help those tales along. I think the foundation won't really have all that much trouble containing him when all is said and done, but as it stands they've just missed him.</p>

